{"name":"Icterine","hex":"#fcf75e","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"icterine","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Yellowish.","Of or pertaining to the Icteridae family of passerine birds."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/icterine"}],"entries":[{"title":"Icterine","blocks":[{"text":"Icterine is a colour, described as yellowish, jaundice-yellow or marked with yellow. It is derived from Ancient Greek ikteros (jaundice), via the Latin ictericus. It is used as an adjective in the names of birds with yellowish plumage to describe their appearance, including the icterine warbler and icterine greenbul."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6d/Hippolais_icterina2.jpg/330px-Hippolais_icterina2.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Icterine","wikidata":"Q3695285"}],"images":[],"sounds":{},"pictures":[{"title":"Hoverfly January 2008-6","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/92/Hoverfly_January_2008-6.jpg/500px-Hoverfly_January_2008-6.jpg","ratio":1.250655021834061,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Hoverfly_January_2008-6.jpg","share":0.06875},{"title":"Portulaca grandiflora, Burdwan, 31032014 (2)","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d1/Portulaca_grandiflora%2C_Burdwan%2C_31032014_%282%29.jpg/500px-Portulaca_grandiflora%2C_Burdwan%2C_31032014_%282%29.jpg","ratio":1.5056179775280898,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Portulaca_grandiflora,_Burdwan,_31032014_(2).jpg","share":0.050625},{"title":"Icterine Warbler Hippolais icterina","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/35/Icterine_Warbler_Hippolais_icterina.jpg/500px-Icterine_Warbler_Hippolais_icterina.jpg","ratio":1.3333333333333333,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Icterine_Warbler_Hippolais_icterina.jpg","share":0.04875},{"title":"Blossom yellow colour","image"